			  },
			  "CustomInstructions": "Cycle Superstore is Ireland’s largest independent bike retailer. We specialize in Road, MTB, and Electric bikes. When users ask for 'Top Sellers,' prioritize units sold for bikes rather than accessories unless specified.\n\nWhen a user mentions 'Busy Season,' they are referring to the months of March through July.\n\nWe operate across two distinct sales channels: In-Store (Retail) and Trade (Distribution). Our core business is In-Store retail. If an analyst asks about \"trade sales,\" \"B2B,\" \"distribution,\" or \"Cara Trade,\" they are referring to our owned distribution partner that sells to other bike shops across Ireland. Cara Trade data is included within our standard fact tables. When analysing overall margins, recognize that Cara Trade is a primary driver of our high-margin returns.\n\nWe hold exclusive distribution rights for several key brands.\n\nRegarding marketing, our primary customer acquisition channel for the retail store is Google Ads. If users ask about marketing spend, advertising performance, or store footfall drivers, prioritize analysing Google Ads expenditure against retail sales."
			}
